# Deploying with Wrangler on a machine without a browser (instead of `npx wrangler login`). Wrangler reads these
# from .env itself. Keep this file private: it's gitignored, and `chmod 600 .env` on shared servers.
# Token: Cloudflare dashboard -> My Profile -> API Tokens -> "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template, scoped to the
# account and the notsocompany.com and notso.company zones. Account ID: right side of either zone's overview page.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
